   "subject": "Meet and Analyze Data, Wed Oct 17th",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n  \r\n\r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n    <p>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:-moz-fixed;font-size:12px\" lang=\"x-unicode\">Hi all,\r\n      <br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      we will be having a Meet and Analyze Data session from\r\n      3:00pm-5:00pm today (10/17),\r\n      <br>\r\n      in the 1013 Valley Hall room (<a href=\"http://campusmap.ucdavis.edu/?b=178\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://campusmap.ucdavis.edu/?b%3D178&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466320789000&amp;usg=AOvVaw34oCooCjqaI2erU0XUntmi\">http://campusmap.ucdavis.edu/?b=178</a>).\r\n      <br>\r\n      Hope to see you there!\r\n      <br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      <div><span>-- <br>\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br>\r\n        If you think you are going to join us, please let us know --\r\n        <br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeUW5QS55uDwDpusGYerY542D_tQubkmPMtUKlGdbmoSWfSSQ/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeUW5QS55uDwDpusGYerY542D_tQubkmPMtUKlGdbmoSWfSSQ/viewform&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466320789000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1O7nIOTGBY6q0QWKeuYl2x\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeUW5QS55uDwDpusGYerY542D_tQubkmPMtUKlGdbmoSWfSSQ/viewform</a>\r\n        <br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        -- <br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        Meet and Analyze Data (MAD) is a forum to bring your biological\r\n        big\r\n        <br>\r\n        data and discuss high level concept problems (what is metagenome\r\n        <br>\r\n        assembly?) and low level coding problems (what does this error\r\n        message\r\n        <br>\r\n        even mean?!) and everything in between. There is no scheduled or\r\n        <br>\r\n        specific activity: people show up with questions about how to\r\n        analyze\r\n        <br>\r\n        their data, or maybe they are willing to help others. We\r\n        typically get\r\n        <br>\r\n        questions about experimental design for\r\n        <br>\r\n        transcriptomic/metagenomic/genomic projects, or how to install\r\n        <br>\r\n        software, or how to run their analysis on clusters or the cloud.\r\n        <br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        Cheers,\r\n        <br>\r\n        Luiz Irber<br>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
