     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Karyn,<div><br></div><div>Over the school year MAD sessions happen once a week. Usually they are either in Glady&#39;s Valley Hall or the CCAH––this quarter they are all in Valley Hall but the room number varies on a couple occasions. The next session will indeed be next Wednesday Oct 24th from 3:00-5:00pm in 1013 Valley Hall but may be in a different location (within Valley Hall) the following week––which the more-short-notice post will always let you know! </div><div><br></div><div>Hopefully that clarifies a things a bit.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Shannon </div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
