     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Fri, Oct 19, 2018 at 12:01 PM Shannon Joslin &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">sejo...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Karyn,<div><br></div><div>Over the school year MAD sessions happen once a week. Usually they are either in Glady&#39;s Valley Hall or the CCAH––this quarter they are all in Valley Hall but the room number varies on a couple occasions. The next session will indeed be next Wednesday Oct 24th from 3:00-5:00pm in 1013 Valley Hall but may be in a different location (within Valley Hall) the following week––which the more-short-notice post will always let you know! </div><div><br></div><div>Hopefully that clarifies a things a bit.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Shannon </div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, Oct 19, 2018 at 11:30 AM, Karyn O&#39;Hearn <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">koh...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">HI,<div><br></div><div>If there is ever one of these again with notice farther out, please post. I wish I had known about this in advance.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Wed, Oct 17, 2018 at 11:32 AM Luiz irber &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lcir...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n  \r\n\r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n    <p>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:-moz-fixed;font-size:12px\" lang=\"x-unicode\">Hi all,\r\n      <br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      we will be having a Meet and Analyze Data session from\r\n      3:00pm-5:00pm today (10/17),\r\n      <br>\r\n      in the 1013 Valley Hall room (<a href=\"http://campusmap.ucdavis.edu/?b=178\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://campusmap.ucdavis.edu/?b%3D178&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466320797000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3tO-Sp8Tan_0yCIxE6EfCk\">http://campusmap.ucdavis.edu/?b=178</a>).\r\n      <br>\r\n      Hope to see you there!\r\n      <br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      <div><span>-- <br>\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br>\r\n        If you think you are going to join us, please let us know --\r\n        <br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeUW5QS55uDwDpusGYerY542D_tQubkmPMtUKlGdbmoSWfSSQ/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeUW5QS55uDwDpusGYerY542D_tQubkmPMtUKlGdbmoSWfSSQ/viewform&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466320797000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JpFFJ37DUxK2H5e4ChfNu\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeUW5QS55uDwDpusGYerY542D_tQubkmPMtUKlGdbmoSWfSSQ/viewform</a>\r\n        <br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        -- <br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        Meet and Analyze Data (MAD) is a forum to bring your biological\r\n        big\r\n        <br>\r\n        data and discuss high level concept problems (what is metagenome\r\n        <br>\r\n        assembly?) and low level coding problems (what does this error\r\n        message\r\n        <br>\r\n        even mean?!) and everything in between. There is no scheduled or\r\n        <br>\r\n        specific activity: people show up with questions about how to\r\n        analyze\r\n        <br>\r\n        their data, or maybe they are willing to help others. We\r\n        typically get\r\n        <br>\r\n        questions about experimental design for\r\n        <br>\r\n        transcriptomic/metagenomic/genomic projects, or how to install\r\n        <br>\r\n        software, or how to run their analysis on clusters or the cloud.\r\n        <br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        Cheers,\r\n        <br>\r\n        Luiz Irber<br>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nCheck out our R resources at <a href=\"http://d-rug.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://d-rug.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466320797000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0PiIDTfzj1NN797SqrMj7P\">http://d-rug.github.io/</a><br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Davis R Users&#39; Group&quot; group.<br></blockquote></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div>"
